{
 "(S0) COMMISSION": "Drafter's note, not Tuesday's read: the commission handed to the drafter was lanes M1 (MPSCALC-116), M2 (MPSCALC-107) and M4 (MPSCALC-118, only if it copies the server's rules exactly) of the 6 Nov 10:06 sweep, one seat, disjoint commits per ticket, tier 2, not deployed. The drafter dropped M4 (reason in the drafter report, D-1). Whether the product owner has said anything on these tickets since: not read by the drafter; Tuesday adds it here.",
 "(S1) STAMP": "STAMPED @NOW@ AEDT 2026-11-06 by @SEAT@. The drafter's own measurements are in the kit and the drafter report (clock prints 10:27 to 10:33 AEDT; main, blobs, pointers and the Jira reads). What Tuesday itself re-read and read whole is written by Tuesday here at the stamp, not pre-written by the drafter.",
